{"id":"reaktion","lemma":"Reaktion","pos":"noun","rank":2012,"glosses":["reaction (responding or countering action)","reaction, reactionary forces"],"ipa":"/ʁeakˈt͡si̯oːn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3c/De-Reaktion.ogg/De-Reaktion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Reaktion","plural":"Reaktionen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist eine gute Reaktion.","en":"That's a good response.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759008","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Eine solche Reaktion war zu erwarten.","en":"Such a reaction was to be expected.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"such","l":"solch"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to expect"}]},{"text":"Es gab sehr unterschiedliche Reaktionen.","en":"Reactions were very mixed.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"differently","l":"unterschiedlich"},null]},{"text":"Was passiert, wenn Sie eine allergische Reaktion haben?","en":"What happens when you have an allergic reaction?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"allergically","l":"allergisch"},null,{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Auf ebendiese Reaktion hatte ich gehofft.","en":"That's exactly the reaction I was hoping for.","words":[{"g":"on"},null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"}]}]}